  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Social Inclusion and Nutrition in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute to reduce poverty by addressing malnutrition and social inclusion amongst children under five, pregnant mothers and school age children. The proposed specific objectives are: Specific objective 1: To strengthen the capacity of the Government to deliver effective social inclusion and nutrition services.Specific objective 2: To promote an integrated nutrition approach leading to the reduction of malnutrition amongst Timorese mother and children.</narrative>
  </description>
